   232	\heading{Sub Type Extension.}
   233	It is possible to modify the above algorithms for partial representation extension of \int\ and
   234	\pint. Instead of describing details of these algorithms, we simply reduce the problems to the type
   235	\both\ which we can solve in time $\O(n+m)$ (as discussed above):
