   162	Consequently hinted-minus-placebo is not yet a meaningful measurement. Once
   163	quota is restored, rerun each arm in its own scratch directory; do not treat
   164	the existing API errors as unsolved model attempts.
   165	
   166	## How to use it
   167	
   168	From the repository root:
   169	
   170	```python
   171	import importlib.util
   172	
   173	path = "results/1207.0255/gen_1207_0255.py"
   174	spec = importlib.util.spec_from_file_location("g", path)
   175	g = importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec)
   176	spec.loader.exec_module(g)
   177	
   178	inst = g.make_instance(seed=7, **g.DIFFICULTY["demo"])
   179	text = g.render(inst)
   180	candidate = g.parse_answer("<answer>" + __import__("json").dumps(inst["answer"]) + "</answer>")
   181	assert g.verify(inst, candidate) == (True, "ok")
   182	```
   183	
   184	Emit samples with:
   185	
   186	```bash
   187	bash scripts/emit.sh 1207.0255 20
   188	```
   189	
   190	## Caveats
   191	
   192	This is intentionally not a complexity-theoretic hard distribution. A tool
   193	that computes residues, or the disclosed `O(n²)` reference, makes it easy; a
   194	structural hint may also make it easy, which would be useful G9 evidence rather
   195	than a rejection. The 0/200,000 estimate is only for the uniform prior that
   196	already assigns one member of each visibly forced size band to every labeled
   197	gap and randomizes ranks. It is not an upper bound against informed modular,
   198	SAT, ILP, CP-SAT, or learned proposals.
   199	
   200	No external SAT/ILP/CP solver or long local search was run. The strongest local
   201	residue-blind attack is capped at 256 restarts, and its 0/8 result says nothing
   202	about more restarts. The compact certificate describes a deterministic full
   203	representation rather than spelling out millions of individual vertex
   204	subpaths; the checker validates that expansion symbolically from the exact path
   205	formula. Finally, the missing oracle and G9 runs are a real release blocker,
   206	not evidence of hardness; rerun `harden.py` with a funded OpenRouter key before
   207	submission.
   208	
   209	The module stays standard-library-only because every native coordinate and
   210	verification operation here is integral; no rational, polynomial, matrix, or
   211	root-isolation helper from `gvlib` is needed.
